WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.025
Unit eighteen. Peer Pressure!

2
00:00:04.001 --> 00:00:07.940
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:11.451
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:15.112
Today we learn about Peer Pressure. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:19.622
Peer pressure. Say it with me. Peer pressure!

6
00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:26.372
Friends. Say it with me. Friends!

7
00:00:29.888 --> 00:00:33.522
Values. Say it with me. Values!

8
00:00:37.006 --> 00:00:40.773
Refuse. Say it with me. Refuse!

9
00:00:44.268 --> 00:00:48.151
Confidence. Say it with me. Confidence!

10
00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:55.067
Choice. Say it with me. Choice!

11
00:00:58.568 --> 00:01:02.634
Consequence. Say it with me. Consequence!

12
00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:09.482
Support. Say it with me. Support!

13
00:01:12.996 --> 00:01:24.046
Peer pressure is when friends push us to do something. Knowing my values gives me confidence to refuse. Every choice has a consequence, and true friends support good choices.

14
00:01:24.096 --> 00:01:25.406
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.788 --> 00:01:32.003
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.053 --> 00:01:33.203
Values!

17
00:01:34.257 --> 00:01:39.572
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.622 --> 00:01:40.891
Consequence!

19
00:01:42.004 --> 00:01:48.289
Did you know? Having one friend who agrees with you makes it much easier to resist pressure!

20
00:01:48.339 --> 00:01:50.418
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.299 --> 00:01:59.700
Think and answer. What is a good way to say no without losing a friend?

22
00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:00.900
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.926 --> 00:02:06.898
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.948 --> 00:02:09.593
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

